  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 07 01 01 01 01 01 F5 02}{F5 86 0F 01 0D 01 65 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 CA 0A}这一层没有\nＦ．Ｏ．Ｅ的气息。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e725_510.bf.json:0:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}不过，请不要掉以轻心，\n继续谨慎前进。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e725_510.bf.json:1:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0C 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 88 08}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}在塔尔塔罗斯躲收割者，\n到了这里还得躲收割者……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e725_510.bf.json:1:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}我们又不是等着收割的庄稼。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e725_510.bf.json:2:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 15 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 B7 0D}对它们来说，\n一切有生命的东西都是目标。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e725_510.bf.json:2:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0C 01 02 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}一旦发现我们，\n想必就会追到天涯海角。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e725_510.bf.json:3:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 07 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 6E 05}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}那什么“糖杀者”有那么强吗？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e725_510.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0C 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}可没你说的那么甜。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e725_510.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 02 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 86 11 01 0D 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}非常强，也很可怕。\n最好不要撞上它。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e725_510.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 03 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 9E 05}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}……原来如此，明白了！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e725_510.bf.json:6:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}Ｆ．Ｏ．Ｅ也好，猎杀者也好，\n就是说个头大的都很强吧！？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e725_510.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 C1 1A 01 01 01 01 01 03 01}{F5 86 0C 01 0C 01 03 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 83 08}……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e725_510.bf.json:7:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0C 01 0C 01 03 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}嗯，行，你这么想就好。\n你保持这样就挺好的。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e725_510.bf.json:8:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 0B 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 87 05}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}等、等等，这是什么意思啊！？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e725_510.bf.json:9:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 11 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 20 0C}就是保持原样就很好……的意思。\n大概吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e725_510.bf.json:9:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 11 01 03 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 74 0C}好了，走吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e725_510.bf.json:10:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 AF 05}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}哦、哦。\n也是。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 }
